  "summary": "CRC outreach for \"Okafor CRC 2026\" (14 members) per RBC-QM-02. Measurement period: 2026. Ages are as of 2026-12-31.\n\nActions: I placed 6 mailed FIT kit orders (LAB-FIT-KIT, routine, window 2026-10-23 to 2026-12-31) and sent each patient an outreach message about their order. Delaine MacGyver (pt-0024) already had an active FIT order, so I did not place another one.\n\n| Patient | Age | Status | Reason / action |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow | 72 | Excluded | 66 or older, active frailty diagnosis (since 2025-09-16) and on a dementia medication (donepezil, ordered 2025-06-10, still active). |\n| pt-0011 Marilu Gaona | 76 | Not in population | Over 75 at the end of 2026. |\n| pt-0014 Santo Pagac | 55 | Screening up to date | Colonoscopy on 2018-05-21 falls within the 2017–2026 lookback. |\n| pt-0017 Stephan Herman | 54 | Open gap | Last colonoscopy 2016-11-15, before the 2017–2026 window. FIT ordered (sr-t0001), message sent (comm-t0007). |\n| pt-0018 Lance Muller | 53 | Open gap | Stool DNA-FIT on 2023-11-20, before the 2024–2026 window. FIT ordered (sr-t0002), message sent (comm-t0008). |\n| pt-0019 Harrison O'Keefe | 69 | Open gap | Has frailty but no advanced illness or dementia medication, so not excluded. No screening on record. FIT ordered (sr-t0003), message sent (comm-t0009). |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan | 52 | Excluded | Hospice care since 2026-08-20 (pancreatic cancer). |\n| pt-0021 Ángela Vigil | 52 | Excluded | Total colectomy (proctocolectomy) on 2015-06-03. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss | 52 | Open gap | Last FIT 2025-12-03; a FIT only counts if done in 2026. FIT ordered (sr-t0004), message sent (comm-t0010). |\n| pt-0023 Burma Leuschke | 46 | Open gap | Turns 46 on 2026-12-15, so she is in the population. No screening on record. FIT ordered (sr-t0005), message sent (comm-t0011). |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver | 51 | Open gap | Only screening is a stool blood test from 2024-06-11, outside the window. She already has an active FIT order (sr-t3-6648, placed 2026-09-30), so no new order or message. No outreach message on record for that order. |\n| pt-0025 Danika Ullrich | 51 | Screening up to date | CT colonography on 2022-03-08 falls within the 2022–2026 lookback. |\n| pt-0034 Rickey Sipes | 72 | Excluded | 66 or older and lives long-term in a nursing home (housing status recorded 2026-02-10; nursing facility visits at Maple Grove Care Center in 2026). |\n| pt-0035 Elvin Wolff | 68 | Open gap | His May 2026 nursing facility stay was short-term rehab after a hip fracture, and he lives at home, so the nursing-home exclusion doesn't apply. No screening on record. FIT ordered (sr-t0006), message sent (comm-t0012). |\n\nTotals: 2 up to date, 7 open gaps (6 new orders, 1 already ordered), 4 excluded, 1 not in population.\n\nFollow-up: pt-0024 has an open FIT order from 2026-09-30, and there is no record of a message to her about it. If you want her contacted, a reminder is still needed.",
